Adapted from Granite 6.2.0 (elementary, Inc. and contributors, LGPL-3.0-or-later):
    the view switcher and the empty-view page (src/Widgets/ModeButton.vala,
    src/Widgets/Welcome.vala), the log format (src/Core/Logger.vala) and the
    cover shadow's blur (src/Utils/PixbufUtils.vala)

The visualizer's classic effects (src/C/classic-visualizer.c) and the bottom
bar's icons come from lchongv's own GTK4 music player. The logos the classic
effects show in the middle:
